Third-party code
----------------
None yet. When code derived from another project is brought in, record it
here: the project, its licence, its copyright line, the contents of its own
NOTICE file if it has one, and which aeo files carry the derived code. Each
such file also keeps the original copyright notice and states that it was
changed.

Apache-2.0 and MIT/BSD sources may be brought in on those terms. GPL or
AGPL sources (Ansible, for one) may not.
